"\n"
"    supereagle - Super Eagle\n"
"\n"
"    nn2x - Nearest-neighbor 2x\n"
"\n"
"    nn3x - Nearest-neighbor 3x\n"
"\n"
"    nn4x - Nearest-neighbor 4x\n"
"\n"
"    nny2x - Nearest-neighbor 2x, y axis only\n"
